    },
    {
      "id": "claim_28981c2dc0a540c79f2472a12be3bb67",
      "statement": "HO 04 81 does not cover monitoring without covered direct physical loss, preventive maintenance, routine cleaning, periodic inspection, non-covered investigation or remediation expenses, replacement of undamaged property solely because fungi are present or suspected, upgrades or redesign, work on non-covered property, or costs otherwise excluded or not expressly covered.",
