      "id": "claim_8542ce058c4544458cb7d80ae92a4f09",
      "statement": "HO 04 81 applies the applicable policy deductible to covered fungi, wet or dry rot, or bacteria loss, and compliance with the endorsement's duties does not increase the available coverage.",
