    {
      "id": "claim_6e920ab03e71442d979d591f2476d9f9",
      "statement": "For an HO 04 81 claim, the insured must report the loss within 30 days under the endorsement's conditions, identify the affected property and known circumstances, protect property, preserve damaged property and evidence when reasonably possible, permit inspection and testing, cooperate, and provide relevant records and claim-supporting documents.",
