      "id": "claim_5f5b4cfe042e459f8ac401ca6c13cf5d",
      "statement": "The North Carolina HO 01 32 amendatory endorsement 2018-05 states a $5,000 maximum for all loss caused by fungi, wet or dry rot, or bacteria regardless of the number of insureds, claims, damaged properties, or occurrences, states that such loss is not covered unless expressly provided, and defines fungi and wet rot in its definitions section.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://forms/HO/NC/HO-01-32/2018-05.md#L667-L685",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b639e3f71b138b1c3dd2f4c355a4eaf2632369e0620a98dd454496e3401bfc8b:"
